 "remarks": "An excellent opportunity to own a two-bedroom condo offering exceptional value in the heart of Stamford's sought-after Springdale neighborhood! Known for its vibrant, small-town feel, Springdale offers the convenience of restaurants and shops right outside your door, with the train station directly across the street. Inside, enjoy a spacious living area, an eat-in kitchen, and the convenience of an in-unit washer and dryer. Assigned parking and low common charges that include heat and hot water add to the appeal. Close to Darien and New Canaan, this ideally located condo is a wonderful choice for a first-time homebuyer or an investor seeking a property in a neighborhood where rentals are in demand. Comfort, convenience, and value-all in one!",
